        "\n",
        "- Nice, clean dataset  \n",
        "- Can be retrieved with special function in `sklearn.datasets`\n",
        "- Describes median price of house in block and some block characteristics\n",
        " \n",
        "\n",
        "#### Loading the Data {.scrollable}\n"
